        "title": "Keep workspace suggestions opt-in for doctor lint",
        "body": "## Summary\n- mark `core/doctor/workspace-suggestions` default-disabled so default `doctor --lint` stays focused on actionable config/runtime problems\n- keep the advisory workspace backup and memory-system suggestions available through `--only core/doctor/workspace-suggestions` or `--all`\n- add selection coverage proving default lint skips the advisory check while explicit selection still reports info findings\n\n## Public surface\n- No public SDK/plugin/config contract changes.\n- Default `doctor --lint` changes only by omitting this advisory `info` check; `--all` and `--only` still include it.\n\n## PR surface\n- 2 files changed, +53/-0 from `main`.\n\n## Validation\n- `node scripts/run-vitest.mjs src/flows/doctor-health-contributions.test.ts src/flows/doctor-core-checks.test.ts` (78 tests)\n- `pnpm exec oxfmt --check src/flows/doctor-core-checks.ts src/flows/doctor-health-contributions.ts src/flows/doctor-health-contributions.test.ts`\n- `pnpm exec oxlint src/flows/doctor-core-checks.ts src/flows/doctor-health-contributions.ts src/flows/doctor-health-contributions.test.ts`\n- `node scripts/plugin-sdk-surface-report.mjs --check`\n- `git diff --check`",
